      },
      "created_at": "2026-11-16T07:00:55.000Z",
      "text": "A tourist bus narrowly escaped a major accident in Gramphu, Lahaul-Spiti, after skidding on a stretch of black ice and crashing into a mountainside. The incident, captured on video and now going viral, highlights the growing dangers posed by freezing temperatures in Himachal Pradesh's high-altitude regions.\n\nFortunately, the bus slid toward the hill rather than the gorge, preventing what could have been a serious disaster. With black ice forming on roads due to sub-zero temperatures, authorities have urged motorists to exercise extreme caution. Lahaul-Spiti Police have already restricted vehicle movement on the route to specific hours, but the latest incident underscores the continuing risks for tourists and drivers alike.\n\n#LahaulSpiti #HimachalPradesh",
