      "created_at": "2026-11-16T03:25:20.000Z",
      "text": "A rare wildlife encounter at Satpura Tiger Reserve, Madhya Pradesh, left tourists amazed after a sloth bear's aggressive display forced a tigress to retreat. The dramatic face-off, captured during a safari in the park's core area, quickly went viral on social media.\n\nWildlife experts say sloth bears are known for their unpredictable and fiercely territorial nature, making even top predators think twice before engaging. The extraordinary sight is a reminder that in the wild, strength isn't always about size, and nature can always surprise.\n\n#SatpuraTigerReserve #Wildlife",
